eads. For each 4 pages printed for the spreads, the press prints a block of 4 ads, each of which take up a quarter of a page. The brochures can be arranged in any order as long as they are made up of 5 pages each. How many brochures is the printing press creating?\nSolution:", "solutions": ["25"], "solution": "25"}, "prompt_tokens": [151644, 872, 198, 50, 3948, 279, 2701, 11972, 34689, 6888, 3491, 13, 6928, 697, 32711, 323, 2182, 279, 1590, 4226, 304, 1124, 79075, 6257, 382, 31198, 25, 362, 18484, 3493, 374, 18484, 2896, 331, 1413, 13, 576, 3493, 23473, 220, 17, 15, 3175, 15112, 42553, 11, 323, 10917, 438, 1657, 1990, 15112, 42553, 13, 1752, 1817, 220, 19, 6816, 16709, 369, 279, 42553, 11], "response_tokens": [151667, 198, 32313, 11, 1077, 594, 1490, 13, 358, 1184, 311, 7071, 700, 1246, 1657, 2896, 331, 1413, 279, 18484, 3493, 374, 6825, 13, 576, 3491, 33845, 2155, 2150, 14579, 369, 279, 2896, 331, 1413, 25, 220, 17, 15, 3175, 15112, 42553, 323, 10917, 438, 1657, 1990, 15112, 42553, 13, 5005, 1052, 594, 264, 6286, 315, 13740, 429, 1896, 705, 220, 15, 13, 17]}
