s 196. So, the area is 196 square inches.\n\nWait, let me check my work again to make sure I didn't make any mistakes. The width is 7, length is 28. Multiply them: 7*28. Let me do 7*28 another way. Since 28 is 7*4, so 7*(7*4) equals 7 squared times 4, which is 49*4=196. Yep, that matches. So that seems right.\n\nI guess that's the area. So, the answer should be 196 square inches. Let me just make sure there's no trick or anything. The problem doesn't mention any other dimensions or anything, just that it's 4 times as long as it is wide. So assuming the rest is straightforward. The width is given, length derived from 4 times, area product. Yep, looks good.\n\n**Final Answer**\nThe area of the rectangle is \\boxed{196}.\n</think>\n\nTo solve the problem, we start by understanding the relationship between the width and the length of the rectangle. The problem states:\n\n- Width = 7 inches  \n- The rectangle is 4 times as long as it is wide, meaning the **length = 4 × width**\n\nSubstituting the given width into this relationship:\n\n$$\n\\text{Length} = 4 \\times 7 = 28 \\text{ inches}\n$$\n\nNow that we have both the width and the length, we can calculate the **area** of the rectangle using the formula for the area of a rectangle:\n\n$$\n\\text{Area} = \\text{Width} \\times \\text{Length}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\text{Area} = 7 \\times 28 = 196\n$$\n\n---\n\n**Final Answer**\n\nThe area of the rectangle is \\boxed{196}.<|im_end|>", "source_record": {"question": "You draw a rectangle that is 7 inches wide. It is 4 times as long as it is wide. What is the area of the rectangle?", "answer": "The length of the rectangle is 4 * 7 inches = <<4*7=28>>28 inches.\nThe area of the rectangle is 7 inches * 28 inches = <<7*28=196>>196 square inches.\n#### 196", "prompt": "Solve the following grade-school math problem. Show your reasoning and put the final answer in \\boxed{}.\n\nProblem: You draw a rectangle that is 7 inches wide. It is 4 times as long as it is wide. What is the area of the rectangle?\nSolution:", "solutions": ["196"], "solution": "196"}, "prompt_tokens": [151644, 872, 198, 50, 3948, 279, 2701, 11972, 34689, 6888, 3491, 13, 6928, 697, 32711, 323, 2182, 279, 1590, 4226, 304, 1124, 79075, 6257, 382, 31198, 25, 1446, 4038, 264, 22756, 429, 374, 220, 22, 14924, 6884, 13, 1084, 374, 220, 19, 3039, 438, 1293, 438, 432, 374, 6884, 13, 3555, 374, 279, 3082, 315, 279, 22756, 5267, 36842, 25, 151645, 198, 151644, 77091], "response_tokens": [151667, 198, 32313, 11, 1077, 752, 1430, 311, 7071, 700, 419, 3491, 13, 2055, 11, 279, 3491, 2727, 498, 4038, 264, 22756, 429, 374, 220, 22, 14924, 6884, 13, 1597, 432, 594, 220, 19, 3039, 438, 1293, 438, 432, 374, 6884, 13, 5005, 582, 1184, 311, 1477, 279, 3082, 315, 279, 22756, 13, 88190, 11, 16910, 382, 5338, 11, 358, 1184, 311, 19091, 1246]}
